        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n    autonumber\n    actor Operator as Main / Operator\n    participant M as mission : ExplorationMission\n    participant C as colony : Colony\n    participant Env as Environment\n    participant A1 as scientist : Scientist\n    participant A2 as rover : ExplorationRover\n\n    Operator-&gt;&gt;M: startMission()\n    activate M\n    M-&gt;&gt;M: submitMission()\n    activate M\n    M-&gt;&gt;C: getActiveMission()\n    C--&gt;&gt;M: currentActiveMission\n    M-&gt;&gt;Env: getState()\n    Env--&gt;&gt;M: currentCondition\n    M-&gt;&gt;A1: isAvailable() &amp; canPerform(this)\n    A1--&gt;&gt;M: capableAndAvailable\n    M-&gt;&gt;A2: isAvailable() &amp; canPerform(this) &amp; getBatteryLevel()\n    A2--&gt;&gt;M: capableAndSufficientBattery\n    M-&gt;&gt;C: checkAvailableEquipment(equipment)\n    C--&gt;&gt;M: equipmentAvailable\n    M-&gt;&gt;C: checkAvailableResources(resources, 30)\n    C--&gt;&gt;M: resourcesAvailable\n    deactivate M\n\n    alt Validation Passes (Accepted Flow)\n        M-&gt;&gt;C: setActiveMission(this)\n        M-&gt;&gt;M: setStatus(ASSIGNED)\n        M-&gt;&gt;A1: setOnMission(true)\n        M-&gt;&gt;A2: setOnMission(true)\n        M-&gt;&gt;C: deductResource(resources, 30)\n        M-&gt;&gt;M: setStatus(IN_PROGRESS)\n        M--&gt;&gt;Operator: true\n\n        loop Each Sol (advanceTime(7))\n            Operator-&gt;&gt;C: advanceTime(1)\n            activate C\n            C-&gt;&gt;M: progress(1)\n            C-&gt;&gt;A2: discharge(5)\n            C-&gt;&gt;A1: increaseFatigue(5)\n            opt M.isCompleted() [timeElapsed &gt;= 7]\n                C-&gt;&gt;M: complete()\n                M-&gt;&gt;M: endMission(COMPLETED)\n                M-&gt;&gt;A1: setOnMission(false)\n                M-&gt;&gt;A2: setOnMission(false)\n                M-&gt;&gt;C: removeActiveMission()\n            end\n            deactivate C\n        end\n    else Validation Fails (Rejected Flow - e.g., Unsuitable Agent / Resource Shortage)\n        M-&gt;&gt;M: setFailureReason(reason)\n        M-&gt;&gt;M: setStatus(FAILED)\n        M-&gt;&gt;C: addMissionToHistory(this)\n        Note over M,C: Mission never becomes activeMission\n        M--&gt;&gt;Operator: false\n    end\n    deactivate M&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null,&#xa;  &quot;version&quot;: &quot;12&quot;&#xa;}" id="l8SWZuApAEbl4fd_skBx-99">
